<!--
  The notification small icon.

  A status-bar icon is drawn as a silhouette: Android discards every colour and keeps only the alpha,
  then tints the result. So this is deliberately a solid white shape on transparent with no gradients
  and no detail that would vanish at 24dp — the launcher icon would come through as a grey blob.

  A check mark inside a rounded square: the app is about answering, and a tick reads at status-bar
  size where anything finer does not.
-->
